{"3421780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Netherborn", "steam_appid": 3421780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/ac2b694eee3c3e20c973c18e46f2da3e.poster.avif?t=1781717321\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/ac2b694eee3c3e20c973c18e46f2da3e.webm?t=1781717321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Hell, child of fire!</strong> <br>You are <strong>Lucius</strong>, the Son of the Devil - forged in agony, born to burn worlds. <br>Your sacred duty? <strong>Erase a peaceful planet and prove that darkness still rules this rotten universe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The guitars scream. The ground trembles.</strong> <br>Every wave of enemies is a new riff of destruction - <br>fur and guts flying through the crimson haze while the drums of hell pound in your chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/555eea18cb11d8668b1635ab03c471fe.poster.avif?t=1781717321\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/555eea18cb11d8668b1635ab03c471fe.webm?t=1781717321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/555eea18cb11d8668b1635ab03c471fe.mp4?t=1781717321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUELIKE HELL ON EARTH</strong> <br>Face endless hordes of enemies and drown them in fire. No rest. No mercy. Just chaos, bullets, and rage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE DEMONIC PETS</strong> <br>Forge creatures from blood, bones, and metal. Fuse materials, awaken monsters, and unleash hellish companions who tear the Furries to shreds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESTRUCTIBLE WORLD</strong> <br>Every wall, every body, every inch of ground can break. Turn the world itself into your weapon of mass damnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPON &amp; SKILL COMBOS</strong> <br>Wield infernal weapons: bone whips, blood-spitting guns, and hammers that shake the underworld. Combine powers for devastating metal mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPIC BOSSES &amp; DEADLY TRAPS</strong> <br>Slay furry gods, plush titans, and twisted cyber-priests. Bathe in their holy blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EASY TO PICK UP - IMPOSSIBLE TO MASTER</strong> <br>Jump in, raise hell, and keep dying gloriously until you learn to dance with death itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/b9b1be8f06df4355e054a0aed5c8e611.poster.avif?t=1781717321\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/b9b1be8f06df4355e054a0aed5c8e611.webm?t=1781717321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DARK HUMOR &amp; HEAVY SATIRE</strong> <br>Love and harmony are for the weak. <br>Here, every hug ends with a broken spine and a metal solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’re not the hero. You’re the apocalypse.</strong> <br>Summon your demonic army. Unleash the storm. <br><strong>Let the world drown in riffs, fire, and fur.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/ac2b694eee3c3e20c973c18e46f2da3e.poster.avif?t=1781717321\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/ac2b694eee3c3e20c973c18e46f2da3e.webm?t=1781717321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Hell, child of fire!</strong> <br>You are <strong>Lucius</strong>, the Son of the Devil - forged in agony, born to burn worlds. <br>Your sacred duty? <strong>Erase a peaceful planet and prove that darkness still rules this rotten universe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The guitars scream. The ground trembles.</strong> <br>Every wave of enemies is a new riff of destruction - <br>fur and guts flying through the crimson haze while the drums of hell pound in your chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/555eea18cb11d8668b1635ab03c471fe.poster.avif?t=1781717321\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/555eea18cb11d8668b1635ab03c471fe.webm?t=1781717321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/555eea18cb11d8668b1635ab03c471fe.mp4?t=1781717321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUELIKE HELL ON EARTH</strong> <br>Face endless hordes of enemies and drown them in fire. No rest. No mercy. Just chaos, bullets, and rage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE DEMONIC PETS</strong> <br>Forge creatures from blood, bones, and metal. Fuse materials, awaken monsters, and unleash hellish companions who tear the Furries to shreds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESTRUCTIBLE WORLD</strong> <br>Every wall, every body, every inch of ground can break. Turn the world itself into your weapon of mass damnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPON &amp; SKILL COMBOS</strong> <br>Wield infernal weapons: bone whips, blood-spitting guns, and hammers that shake the underworld. Combine powers for devastating metal mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPIC BOSSES &amp; DEADLY TRAPS</strong> <br>Slay furry gods, plush titans, and twisted cyber-priests. Bathe in their holy blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EASY TO PICK UP - IMPOSSIBLE TO MASTER</strong> <br>Jump in, raise hell, and keep dying gloriously until you learn to dance with death itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/b9b1be8f06df4355e054a0aed5c8e611.poster.avif?t=1781717321\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/extras/b9b1be8f06df4355e054a0aed5c8e611.webm?t=1781717321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DARK HUMOR &amp; HEAVY SATIRE</strong> <br>Love and harmony are for the weak. <br>Here, every hug ends with a broken spine and a metal solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’re not the hero. You’re the apocalypse.</strong> <br>Summon your demonic army. Unleash the storm. <br><strong>Let the world drown in riffs, fire, and fur.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Become the embodiment of demonic fury in Netherborn, a fast-paced roguelite where you play as Lucius,the son of the Devil himself. Rip through hordes of twisted Furia creatures,unleash and evolve hellish abilities and carve your way through an endless onslaught in a world that refuses to let you go.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/cf8780c6b9fde090fcb06cf2c9697b529f7e2ea3/header.jpg?t=1781717321", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/91253982ec663e302ea8e8a94d055f3d2bbb7c84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781717321", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421780/91253982ec663e302ea8e8a94d055f3d2bbb7c84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781717321", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7/8/10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-4150 or AMD Ryzen™ 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 770<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 144 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7/8/10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-4150 or AMD Ryzen™ 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX  1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 144 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><b